From 7c4d50f6d348a42d0bfdf0ea240e9d36d9134d95 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gustavo Cateim <cateim@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 11:08:30 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat(send): upload a high-quality thumbnail for link
 previews

- added the high-quality link thumbnail upload so whatsapp renders the large preview card instead of the small one
- used the url, title, description and imgUrl sent by the caller, fetching the page only for missing fields
- fetched the page with a link-preview user agent, a 10s timeout and a size limit, rejecting non-2xx responses
- kept the send going when the preview fails, with a smaller card or none
- changed the preview type from video to none and read og:title and relative og:image urls

Closes #103
